<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies seven issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies seven issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following seven municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Imperial USD, Calif., $2 million general obligations.</p>
<p>--Illinois, $60 million sales tax revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Massachusetts, $200 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Woburn, Mass., $7.045 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Woodbury, N.Y., $8.88 million GO improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--East Aurora UFSD, N.Y., $9.9 million school district GOs.</p>
<p>--New York State, $215.42 million GOs. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
